<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS6.SSS0.Px9" title="In A.6 Competition Information ‣ Appendix A Dataset Construction ‣ LiveOIBench: Can Large Language Models Outperform Human Contestants in Informatics Olympiads?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Asia-Pacific Informatics Olympiad (APIO)</span></span></a></li>
