<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS6.SSS0.Px11" title="In A.6 Competition Information ‣ Appendix A Dataset Construction ‣ LiveOIBench: Can Large Language Models Outperform Human Contestants in Informatics Olympiads?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Canadian Computing Olympiad (CCO)</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS6.SSS0.Px12" title="In A.6 Competition Information ‣ Appendix A Dataset Construction ‣ LiveOIBench: Can Large Language Models Outperform Human Contestants in Informatics Olympiads?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Croatian Open Competition in Informatics (COCI)</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS6.SSS0.Px13" title="In A.6 Competition Information ‣ Appendix A Dataset Construction ‣ LiveOIBench: Can Large Language Models Outperform Human Contestants in Informatics Olympiads?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Nordic Olympiad in Informatics (NOI)</span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A1.SS6.SSS0.Px14" title="In A.6 Competition Information ‣ Appendix A Dataset Construction ‣ LiveOIBench: Can Large Language Models Outperform Human Contestants in Informatics Olympiads?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_ref ltx_href">USA Computing Olympiad (USACO)</span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In LiveOIBench: Can Large Language Models Outperform Human Contestants in Informatics Olympiads?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B </span>Model Information</span></a></li>
